    "institutions_today": [],
    "paragraph": "The UrbanFormAnalyzer introduces an open-source Python library integrated with QGIS to automatically extract orientation-specific external perimeters and envelope descriptors from cadastral geometries. Another study produces annual 1-kilometer resolution global maps estimating the probability of 2G, 3G, and 4G mobile network coverage across 214 countries and territories from 1999 to 2030. Finally, archaeological excavations at Juukan Gorge recovered the first physical evidence of Tasmanian devils in northwestern Australia's Pilbara region, analyzing a Holocene dentary fragment and a pre-LGM Late Pleistocene premolar.",
